{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X的叙事压缩有时损失心理解释的完整性，尤其S12少了Y明确表达的“受过的气和开心过都可以记着”这一层自我接纳。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为边听边扫的普通观众，X的重点放大加亮，能让我迅速抓住每段人物心理的转折；感受词按音乐时点出现，也避免了Y在S03等段把大量不同情绪同时摆在眼前。X对音乐中的情绪变化、身体反应和细微声响拆解得更具体，人物从不甘、怀念、动摇到带着想念继续生活的整体轨迹也更清楚。不过，Y有些叙事句保留了更完整的因果解释，人物为什么产生某种想法，有时交代得更充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ebcfaa41-3143-4216-b59e-df4a434aeefb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T023017436647Z", "elapsed_seconds": 68.297, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T02:31:25.740658+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b929f25ac3f20f1a663b292c4db34e7fb9d74fb3cb6a31d7e7e9ce509c63aec8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_at